# Explorations (task invariants)

When editing `src/explorations/` or shared `src/eComponents/`:

## Canonical source of truth

- **Schema:** `src/explorations/canonicalTypes.ts` — add new shared fields here first
- **Instance:** `src/explorations/eip-NNNN/canonical.ts` → `export const CANONICAL`
- **`info.ts`:** website chrome only (path, HTML, images, SEO). May spread `CANONICAL` for display; do not add shared meaning only in `info.ts`
- Replicate into engine module + mcp-docs; website `CANONICAL` wins on conflict

## No orphan explorations

Every live exploration needs `mcp-docs/use/eips/eip-NNNN.md` (Runnable or Planned). See [brief-protocol-change skill](../skills/brief-protocol-change/SKILL.md).

## Taxonomies

Read valid IDs from source — do not guess:

- `src/explorations/TOPICS.ts` — static set
- `src/explorations/TIMELINE.ts` — hardforks + maturity stages
- `src/explorations/TAGS.ts` — enum; new tags must follow [architecture § tags](../../website-docs/guide/architecture.md#tags)

## Building blocks

1. Check [available-e-components.md](../../website-docs/contributing/available-e-components.md) before custom UI.
2. One primary E-Component shell per exploration unless explicitly designing a new shared pattern. **Future-driven shared components:** when design identifies reusable receipt/log/state UI (or similar) useful beyond this EIP, implement the E-Component sub-round first (see [add-exploration skill](../skills/add-exploration/SKILL.md)), then integrate.
3. Extension UI goes **inside** E-Component slots (`#below`, `#result`) — not as siblings (provide/inject is descendant-only).
4. **Result slot must match `changeNature`** — gas compare only for `repricing`; validity/output for `new-capability` precompiles.

## Styling and deps

- Use `e-*` design-system classes from `src/main.css` — no hardcoded Tailwind color utilities on exploration UI. Do not re-list CSS class tables in prompts; read source.
- Import third-party libraries only in the exploration folder (or exploration-local modules), not in E-Components.

## Registration

Every new exploration needs an import in `src/explorations/REGISTRY.ts` or it will not appear in nav.

**Latest on the home page:** prepend the id to `featured` in `src/views/HomeView.vue` (and the copy in `HomeView.spec.ts`). `latestExplorations = featured.slice(0, 3)` — new exploration is Latest; the previous third Latest leaves the trio.

## Cover art

Every exploration ships `image.webp` imported from `info.ts`. Playbook: [cover-image skill](../skills/cover-image/SKILL.md).

## Procedure

New exploration workflow: [round-trip-protocol-change](../skills/round-trip-protocol-change/SKILL.md) (brief → exploration → MCP). Subskills: [brief-protocol-change](../skills/brief-protocol-change/SKILL.md) → [add-exploration](../skills/add-exploration/SKILL.md) + [adding-an-exploration.md](../../website-docs/contributing/adding-an-exploration.md).

Tests passing is the quality bar, not the pedagogy bar — human must review intro, usage, and examples.
